What is derived: the MCP tool names and input field shapes, the memory and
conversation category vocabularies, the /v1/mcp and /v1/stt route paths, and
the designed behaviour of failing closed on unknown categories.

What is NOT derived: no source file from BasedHardware/omi is copied into this
repository. The implementation here is independent and written against the
observed contract. OMI's client remains MIT and unmodified.

Apache-2.0 is compatible with this arrangement; MIT imposes only attribution.
